        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Edmond Harjo\n- Organizations: Seminole Nation of Oklahoma\n- Events: Normandy landings, Battle of Iwo Jima\n- Topics: Code talkers, Allied victory on the Western Front\n\nFacts:\n- The Normandy landings were the largest seaborne invasion in history.\n- The Normandy landings began the liberation of German-occupied northwestern Europe from Nazi control and contributed to the Allied victory on the Western Front.\n- Edmond Harjo served with his brothers at the Normandy landings and the Battle of Iwo Jima.\n- Edmond Harjo was the last surviving code talker from the Seminole Nation of Oklahoma.",
